description	"The Clone Trooper

Based on open mode's clone trooper class, but given the full set of upgrades (other than clone rifle 3) and double the reinforcements.

^2Weaponry:
- DC-17 Hand Blaster (2)
- DC-15S Carbine (3)
- DC-15A Blaster Rifle (2)
-- 6 Concussion & Ion Blasts

^8Attributes:
- Stamina (3)
- Heal (2)
- 3 Reinforcements (CTF: 7.5s Respawn)
- Assemble (1) - Respawns on characters with Rally

^3Abilities:
- Sprint ^3[CS1]

^2Strengths^7: Strikes a good balance between individual troop strength and numbers.
^1Weaknesses^7: Somewhat ineffectual at close and long ranges."